// Service_Model_Lifecycle — Model Lifecycle Layer (layanan, tanpa alat)
// Render manual: https://app.eraser.io > Diagram-as-code (cloud architecture).
//   Buat kanvas BARU bernama "Service_Model_Lifecycle".
// Ekspor PNG ke materials/reports/figures/Service_Model_Lifecycle.png
// Acuan: fig:service-model-lifecycle (Subbab IV.2.3, subsec:rincian-kelompok);
//   rincian bebas-tool kelompok baris 5 Tabel layanan_industri, komponen verbatim.
// Sumber edge: amershi2019software (urutan feature engineering, model training,
//   model evaluation), kreuzberger2023mlops dan googlecloud2024mlops (model
//   registry dan ML metadata store), najafabadi2024analysis (inference service).
// Ikon generik (bebas-tool), nama diverifikasi docs.eraser.io/docs/icons 2026-07-11.
// Rendering WAJIB horizontal (direction right), maksimum dua baris node dalam grup,
//   tanpa \rotatebox pada LaTeX.

direction right

// Masukan fitur dan rilis (batas)
Feature Service Layer [icon: package, color: green, label: "Feature Service Layer"]
GitOps and Continuous Delivery Layer [icon: git-branch, color: blue, label: "GitOps and Continuous Delivery Layer"]

Model Lifecycle Layer [icon: refresh-cw, color: purple] {
  feature engineering [icon: sliders]
  model training [icon: cpu]
  model evaluation [icon: gauge]
  ML metadata store [icon: database]
  model registry [icon: archive]
  model serving component [icon: send]
  inference service [icon: globe]
}

// Konsumen telemetri (batas)
Observability Layer [icon: eye, color: teal, label: "Observability Layer"]

// Tahapan siklus model (amershi2019software)
Feature Service Layer > feature engineering: fitur
feature engineering > model training: fitur siap latih
model training > model evaluation: kandidat model
model evaluation > model registry: model lolos evaluasi

// Metadata eksperimen dan evaluasi (googlecloud2024mlops, kreuzberger2023mlops)
model training > ML metadata store: catatan eksperimen
model evaluation > ML metadata store: metrik evaluasi

// Rilis model ke penyajian (googlecloud2024mlops, najafabadi2024analysis)
model registry > model serving component: model rilis
GitOps and Continuous Delivery Layer > model serving component: rilis otomatis
model serving component > inference service: endpoint inferensi
inference service > Observability Layer: telemetri model
